  {
   "start": 1396.523,
   "end": 1440.971,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "segment": "day-reflect-121",
     "text": "Every time you leave a place today and every time you arrive, the Lord is there, at both ends of the journey.",
     "start": 1396.523,
     "end": 1404.608
    },
    {
     "segment": "day-reflect-121",
     "text": "Carry that with you.",
     "start": 1404.788,
     "end": 1406.516
    },
    {
     "segment": "payoff",
     "text": "Here is one thing to take into your day.",
     "start": 1408.196,
     "end": 1411.396
    },
    {
     "segment": "payoff",
     "text": "Each time you leave a place today, your home, your car, your office, whisper, The Lord is my refuge.",
     "start": 1411.576,
     "end": 1419.384
    },
    {
     "segment": "payoff",
     "text": "Six words.",
     "start": 1419.564,
     "end": 1421.057
    },
    {
     "segment": "payoff",
     "text": "Let them mark every doorway you walk through.",
     "start": 1421.237,
     "end": 1424.587
    },
    {
     "segment": "blessing",
     "text": "And now receive this blessing.",
     "start": 1425.967,
     "end": 1428.356
    },
    {
     "segment": "blessing",
     "text": "The LORD shall preserve thy going out and thy coming in from this time forth, and even for evermore.",
     "start": 1428.536,
     "end": 1435.555
    },
    {
     "segment": "blessing",
     "text": "Go into this day covered by his peace.",
     "start": 1435.735,
     "end": 1438.337
    },
    {
     "segment": "blessing",
     "text": "In Jesus' name, amen.",
     "start": 1438.517,
     "end": 1440.971
    }
   ],
   "segments": [
